  << /ActualText (Designed enterprise platforms across fintech\054 payments\054 and Web3 for clients like Coinbase\054 Binance\054 Hedera\054 and the Solana Foundation\056 Owned features end\055to\055end from early discovery through to final delivery\054 covering everything from User flows and Wireframes to polished UI and interactive Prototypes\056 \n\nTook full responsibility for the Design process on each engagement\054 starting with understanding what the client actually needed and seeing it through all the way to deployment\056 \n\nApplied and maintained a consistent design system across multiple client products\056 Ran design QA during development\054 iterating on solutions based on engineering feedback and usability findings\056 Ensured all designs met WCAG accessibility standards\073 conducted design QA during development handoff\056\n\nLed end\055to\055end UX research on a Web3 education platform \050OpusEdu\051\072 designed and ran generative user interviews across creator and learner segments\054 built a quantitative usability study\054 and synthesised findings into actionable product recommendations\056)
